@dsh-gsd/bundle
================

This bundle is a faithful reimplementation of opengsd-core (Git Ship Done),
the artefact-driven engineering loop. The role prompts (researcher, planner,
plan-checker, executor, verifier, ui-researcher, ui-checker, codebase-mapper)
are condensed faithfully from opengsd's `agents/*.md`.

